    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32204" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Octōdūrus</span></b> , i,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town of the Veragri</i>, <i>in</i> Gallia
			Narbonensis, the modern <i>Martigny</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G. 3,
				1</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Octō-dūrensis</span></b> , e,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Octodurus;</i> in plur.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Octōdūrenses</span></b> ,
				ĭum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Octodurus</i>, <i>the
				Octodurians</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 20, 24, §
		135</span></i>.</div>
